  "retained_critical_boundary": "Cache default path creates another object with the original UUID, requests add before old removal but ignores the accept boolean. The returned unadmitted item can still attempt a neighbor merge under static conditions because the living check is not a registration check. Proof needs both destination admission result before merge and paired world objects. Canceling before normal travel callback differs from an unacknowledged destination add.",
